| **Qwen3 perf/watt (tok/sec/W)** | 0.12 tok/s/W | 0.60 tok/s/W | Power meter + inference |
| **Embedding lookup latency** | 120 ns (hash table) | 12 ns (coordinate direct) | Micro-benchmark |
