- Egyptian Decans: Wikipedia (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Decan)
- 36 × 10° = 360° (ancient Egyptian astronomy)
- 40 × 9° = 360° (vTPU sentron architecture)
- 45 - 40 = 5 (Will's observation, 2026-02-16)
