#[test] fn test_coordinate_to_hexagram() { ... }
#[test] fn test_hexagram_transformation() { ... }
#[test] fn test_yarrow_stalk_method() { ... }
```
**Implementation:** `src/iching.rs` (303 lines)  
**Result:** 5/5 tests pass, ancient wisdom validated

