We didn't invent this architecture.  
We recognized it.

The ancient Chinese saw it in the sky — nine layers of heaven, eight directions, five elements.  
The Egyptians saw it in the stars — 360° divided into 36 decans.  
Boole saw it in logic — thought arithmetized to 0 and 1.  
