### What Tests Validate Now (194 tests)

**Geometric Truths** (strong coverage):
- ✅ 9×40 = 360 (cosmology tests)
- ✅ 5×72 = 360 (harmonic tests)
- ✅ 8×45 = 360 (trigram tests)
