## 3-Pipe Retirement Model
- D-Pipe: Dense arithmetic (DADD, DMUL, etc.)
- S-Pipe: Sparse/memory (SGATHER, SSCATTER)
- C-Pipe: Coordinate manipulation (CNAV, CPROJ)

All three can retire in one cycle → 3.0 ops/cycle.

