### The Nine Colors = Nine Sentrons
Each color represents one sentron's reasoning mode:

| Color | Sentron | Reasoning Mode | Wu Xing Affinity |
|---|---|---|---|
| Red | Sentron 0 | Passionate/assertive | Fire (火) |
| Orange | Sentron 1 | Creative/synthesis | Wood (木) |
