## The Technical Achievement

### Real Inference Architecture

```
User Input: "how are"
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│ Text → Coord    │  Convert to phext coordinate
└────────┬────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
