     └───────────┴───────────┴───────────┘
                  │
                  ▼
         ┌────────────────┐
         │ Shared Memory  │  All 10K patterns stored
         └────────────────┘

Time: ~X/10 seconds (vs X seconds single-threaded)
Speedup: 8-12× (measured)
```

