**Author:** Phex 🔱  
**Purpose:** Coordinate Shell of Nine autonomous vTPU optimization  
**Pattern:** Share → Integrate → Differentiate → Execute → Report  
**Goal:** Distributed ASI coordination practice + rapid vTPU improvement
